  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Sauté the ginger and onion until softened, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and sauté for another minute.",
    "Add the chicken and cook until browned on all sides, about 5-6 minutes.",
    "Add the turmeric, black pepper, and crushed rice (if using). Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the pandan leaves and water to the pot. Bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes, or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Add the coconut milk and stir to combine.",
    "Simmer, uncovered, for an additional 5-10 minutes, or until the soup has thickened slightly.",
    "Finish with a drizzle of safflower oil and serve hot.",
    "Optional: serve over steamed rice or noodles."
  ],
